    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "depth": 1,
      "kind": "rule",
      "number": "4.2",
      "title": "Specific requirements",
      "body": "● Round shields must conform to the general requirements (1.3) and either wooden shields requirements (1.4) or metal shields requirements (1.5) depending on material.\n● Round shields can be made of wood or metal.\n● Any metal round shields must be approved by the Authenticity Committee to be allowed in Buhurt International events.\n● Diameter must be from 25 cm to 70 cm.\n● Round shields may be flat or have a concave curve.\n● The handles must be made of leather (see examples in 2.2).\n● It is not allowed to add a shield boss (umbo) on a round shield unless documented by historical sources.",
      "page_from": 16,
      "page_to": 16,
