    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "depth": 1,
      "kind": "rule",
      "number": "5.1",
      "title": "Historical sources and datation",
      "body": "● Buckler is a small round shield made of wood or metal. It does not have straps but a rigid handle and a shield boss (umbo).\n● They are approved for 14th century, Transitional armors and 15th century armors.\n\nWeltchronik in Versen - 1370 - Germany",
      "page_from": 18,
      "page_to": 18,
