      "depth": 1,
      "kind": "rule",
      "number": "6.1",
      "title": "Historical sources and datation",
      "body": "● Leather straps were fastened with nails or rivets.\n● The following methods are approved for 14th century, Transitional armors and 15th century armors:\n○ Nails ○ Rivets ○ Modern nuts and bolt\n\nNails Rivet with metal plate Pictures from Black Dog Armoury ©",
      "page_from": 21,
