    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "depth": 1,
      "kind": "rule",
      "number": "6.2",
      "title": "Specific requirements",
      "body": "● Nails and rivets can be left visible.\n● Modern nuts and bolts must be concealed by one of the following methods:\n○ Covered by a piece of leather nailed to the shield.\n○ Painted in black or any other color to make it concealed.\n○ Hexagonal unpainted bolts must be ground to a rounded shape, replicating a rivet aesthetic.\n● Bolts must not protrude from the nuts.",
      "page_from": 21,
